<https://opus-project.eu/letter/Smith1_letter_26> a opus:LetterManifestation,
        schema:CreativeWork ;
    dcterms:abstract "This letter, written on August 14th 1592, presents a report by Henry Wotton to Baron Edward La Zouche, detailing the recent affairs in Europe, particularly Florence, where the author is stationed, and England, from where came news of a regicide plot by Mary Queen of Scots. Codenames are given for certain figures to be used in later correspondence. The author also touches upon more personal matters, mainly concerning the activities of his brothers, one of whom has recently lost his wife. " ;
    dcterms:subject <https://opus-project.eu/keyword/codenames>,
        <https://opus-project.eu/keyword/conspiracy>,
        <https://opus-project.eu/keyword/crime>,
