        <https://opus-project.eu/keyword/politics> ;
    bibo:edition "Pearsall Smith 1907, pp. 340-343" ;
    skos:note "Author lists pseudonyms to be used in future correspondence: \"Hereafter, between your Honour and me, I desire myself may stand for the Lord Treasurer, Doctor Blotius for the Great Duke, and John de Taxis for the Lord Darcy." ;
