<https://opus-project.eu/letter/Smith1_letter_29> a opus:LetterManifestation,
        schema:CreativeWork ;
    dcterms:abstract "This letter, written on September 19th 1592, presents a report by Henry Wotton to Baron Edward La Zouche, detailing the recent affairs in Italy. The author presents his plans to leave Florence in the upcoming days and travel to Sienna. He also informs of the arrival Lord Darcy (codename: John de Taxis) to Florence." ;
