        schema:CreativeWork ;
    dcterms:abstract "Henry Wotton writes to Sir Thomas Edmondes, the English ambassador in Brussels, with brief updates from Venice, where he returned to after September villeggiatura. He relates the current state of the city, now full with representatives of European monarchies and noble families, particularly those from France and Spain. " ;
